WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t2-08-appreciation-support.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.300
You've been carrying something heavy.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.570
And nobody seems to notice.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:10.490
Or worse, they see it and step right past it.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.230
There is a specific quiet exhaustion.

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.970
That comes from being the one who holds things together.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:28.060
While feeling entirely invisible in your own effort.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.910
Nothing here is going to tell you that people do their best.

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:35.020
Or that it doesn't matter what others think.

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:36.670
It does matter.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.560
And feeling unsupported is a lonely place to be.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.920
You don't need to explain yourself here.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.170
Or prove.

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:52.060
How much you've been doing.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:00.480
When you consistently put out more care, attention and effort.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.270
Then comes back to you.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:05.940
Your nervous system eventually stops reaching out.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.510
It retracts.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:14.950
That quiet flat feeling isn't bitterness.

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:18.700
It is a protective wall, your system built.

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:21.890
Because being exposed and an acknowledged.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.450
Or too much.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:32.890
The next few minutes are simply a space where nothing is being demanded from
you.

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:37.850
And where your effort doesn't need to be validated by anyone else.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.320
We will move through this slowly.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.410
Before we begin.

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.990
Let's check in with your posture.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:00.270
Without fixing how you look

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:03.950
Can you let your elbows rest heavy against your sides?

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:08.110
If you are comfortable, cross your arms gently.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:11.120
Holding your own shoulders or forearms.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:14.590
Feel the outer boundary of your own arms

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.990
That is your own frame holding you right now.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:21.720
You are bounded safe and present in this room.

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:25.710
Start by naming the feeling in just one word.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:32.680
Maybe that word is invisible.

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.690
Maybe it is discarded heavy or alone.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.910
You don't have to locate where that pain sits.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:40.700
6. In your muscles are chest.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:46.040
In this state, trying to pinpoint the feeling can just feel like more work.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.520
Let it be broad and diffuse.

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:56.100
Here is what is worth holding on to right now

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:07.140
Being unseen by others is an accurate reflection of their capacity, not your
value.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.640
When a system is exhausted from being unappreciated

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.170
It begins to confuse other people's blindness.

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:23.460
With its own insignificance.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:25.850
They are not the same thing.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.620
Now we shift toward regulation.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.310
This isn't about convincing yourself

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.300
That you don't need support

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:37.370
It is about restoring a small drop of safety.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.740
To a system that feels completely on its own.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.470
A steady, unhurried breath.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.580
And the physical weight of your own hands against your body.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.540
Keep your arms wrapped

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.660
Or place one hand flat against the center of your chest.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:11.740
Feel the warmth of your own skin through your clothes

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:23.290
You are offering your body the steady attention.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:26.820
That hasn't been coming from the outside.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.800
Now the bread

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.180
Natural and easy

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.630
And even breath in.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.190
And a soft breath out.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.970
Nothing stretched, nothing forced.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.070
Thoughts may arise.

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:01.790
Or list of things you've done that went unnoticed.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.650
Let them sit there

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:11.340
Imagine those thoughts written on postcards

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.530
Stacking up on a table across the room.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:20.370
You don't need to pick them up, sort them, or send them to anyone right now.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:24.600
Just let the stack sit there while you stay right here.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.860
Rest in this space for a moment longer.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:32.240
Giving yourself attention when you feel unappreciated

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.370
Can feel unfamiliar

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.170
Even uncomfortable.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:42.330
Stay anyway

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:45.230
There are two distinct layers to this weight.

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:48.220
And the second one is what makes it so sharp.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.420
There is the fact itself.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:53.510
The lack of support or acknowledgement

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:55.470
From the people around you.

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:59.650
And then there is the internal question running the neat it.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.980
Why am I always the one who has to handle this?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.410
Am I asking for too much?

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:09.150
That second layer turns an unfair situation.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:10.970
Into a personal defect

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:20.320
It makes you feel guilty for simply having basic human needs.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:22.710
For connection and gratitude.

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:32.680
Put down that second layer, you can leave the disappointment as it is.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.200
But you don't need to blame yourself for feeling it.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:44.950
Notice the question floating softly in the background.

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:52.840
What was this protection keeping me safe from?

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:01.460
Retracting into yourself is what a system does.

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.920
When reaching out repeatedly yields nothing.

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:15.830
It is a smart, protective mechanism designed to conserve your dignity and
energy.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.710
You don't need to figure out what to do next today.

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:25.830
Keep the question gently.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:29.050
It is worth revisiting when you feel steadier.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.100
Unseen by others perhaps

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:37.990
But fully accounted for, right here by yourself.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:47.940
Not receiving support does not mean you are not worth supporting.

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:50.920
Now bring to mind one small boundary

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:52.750
Or act of preservation.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:54.310
For the rest of today.

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.520
Not a confrontation.

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:04.650
Just an act of turning your energy back toward yourself.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:11.490
Stepping away from a task

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:15.910
That isn't yours to finish, saying no to an extra request.

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:21.550
Or simply taking 20 minutes to sit without being available to anyone.

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:30.360
Pick just one small way to protect your energy.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:33.190
That is where your attention goes next.

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:36.510
When you take that step, acknowledge to yourself.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:41.580
Let you chose your own balance, take one final easy bread.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:46.370
Deep in

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.470
And fully out.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:55.460
You are allowed to feel disappointed

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.910
And you are allowed to rest, relax your shoulders.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.930
Take your time getting up

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.630
And open your eyes whenever you are ready.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.570
Return to this practice as often as you need to.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.650
Until you no longer do.
